  "tourFirstWordTitle": "Ijambo rya mbere",
  "tourFirstWordDesc": "(Ayah Urufunguzo)\n\nIgenzura uko (Ijambo ryambere) rya buri murongo kurupapuro kugirango ushimangire intangiriro yimirongo:\n- Hisha ijambo ryambere\n- Erekana ijambo ryambere",
  "tourLastWordTitle": "Ijambo ryanyuma",
  "tourLastWordDesc": "(Ayah Impera)\n\nIgenzura uko (Ijambo ryanyuma) rya buri murongo kurupapuro kugirango uhindure iherezo ryimirongo:\n- Hisha ijambo ryanyuma\n- Erekana ijambo ryanyuma",
  "tourSurahNameTitle": "Izina rya Surat",
  "tourSurahNameDesc": "Kanda ku izina rya Surat kugirango ubone ibintu byateye imbere:\n- Gereranya urwego rwo gufata mu mutwe kuri Sura yose\n- Gereranya itsinda ryimirongo muri Surat hamwe nurwego rumwe icyarimwe",
  "tourAyahNumberTitle": "Ayah Umubare",
  "tourAyahNumberDesc": "Kanda kuri numero ya Ayah kugirango ubone ibintu byateye imbere:\n- Ingufu zo gufata mu mutwe:\n  • Intege nke\n  Hagati\n  • Nibyiza\n- Ongeraho ikimenyetso cyumurongo\n- Reba Mutashabihat hamwe numurongo",
  "tourAyahColorsTitle": "Amabara yo gufata mu mutwe",
  "tourAyahColorsDesc": "<div style = \"kwerekana: flex; flex-icyerekezo: inkingi; icyuho: 15px; margin-hejuru: 10px;\">\n    <div style = \"imyandikire-ingano: 0.95em; ibara: # cbd5e1;\"> Ibara ryumubare wa Ayah rihinduka ukurikije urwego rwo gufata mu mutwe washyizeho: </div>\n    \n    <div style = \"kwerekana: flex; gutsindishiriza-ibirimo: umwanya-hafi; guhuza-ibintu: hagati; inyuma: rgba (255,255,255,0.05); padi: 15px; imipaka-radiyo: 12px;\">\n        <! - Intege nke ->\n        <div style = \"kwerekana: flex; flex-icyerekezo: inkingi; guhuza-ibintu: hagati; icyuho: 8px;\">\n            <div style = \"ubugari: 40px; uburebure: 40px; imipaka-radiyo: 50%; inyuma: rgba (239, 68, 68, 0.2); umupaka: 2px ikomeye # ef4444; kwerekana: flex; guhuza-ibintu: hagati; kwemeza-ibirimo: hagati; umwanya: isano;\">\n                 <span style = \"ibara: # ef4444; imyandikire-ingano: 18px; imyandikire-uburemere: itinyutse;\"> 🔴 </span>\n            </div>\n            <span style = \"Imyandikire-Ingano: 0.8em; ibara: # ef4444;\"> Intege nke </span>\n        </div>\n        \n        <! - Hagati ->\n        <div style = \"kwerekana: flex; flex-icyerekezo: inkingi; guhuza-ibintu: hagati; icyuho: 8px;\">\n            <div style = \"ubugari: 40px; uburebure: 40px; imipaka-radiyo: 50%; inyuma: rgba (234, 179, 8, 0.2); umupaka: 2px ikomeye # eab308; kwerekana: flex; guhuza-ibintu: hagati; kwemeza-ibirimo: hagati; umwanya: isano;\">\n                 <span style = \"ibara: # eab308; ingano-ingano: 18px; imyandikire-uburemere: itinyutse;\"> 🟡 </span>\n            </div>\n            <span style = \"Imyandikire-Ingano: 0.8em; ibara: # eab308;\"> Hagati </span>\n        </div>\n\n        <! - Nibyiza ->\n        <div style = \"kwerekana: flex; flex-icyerekezo: inkingi; guhuza-ibintu: hagati; icyuho: 8px;\">\n            <div style = \"ubugari: 40px; uburebure: 40px; imipaka-radiyo: 50%; inyuma: rgba (34, 197, 94, 0.2); umupaka: 2px ikomeye # 22c55e; kwerekana: flex; guhuza-ibintu: hagati; kwemeza-ibirimo: hagati; umwanya: isano;\">\n                 <span style = \"ibara: # 22c55e; imyandikire-ingano: 18px; imyandikire-uburemere: itinyutse;\"> 🟢 </span>\n            </div>\n            <span style = \"Imyandikire-Ingano: 0.8em; ibara: # 22c55e;\"> Nziza </span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>",
